      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes this would be awesome, I'm a fan of exposing more stuff to Udon.\n\nI'm not sure what you mean by Spawn Radius since that has never been changeable in the scene descriptor, but if you mean the radius around a spawn point where portals are forbidden, that would be nice to change too.\n\nJust in general I would like to be able to change more about where portals are allowed or not.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/expose-allow-portals-to-udon",
